OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 3 DEC
OL,4,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GChoral Vespers from Arundel
OL,6,     GCathedral, with music by James
OL,7,     GMacMillan, Bevan, Mendelssohn and
OL,8,     GOldroyd.
OL,9,G1600FComposer of the Week: John Rutter
OL,10,     GDonald Macleod speaks to John
OL,11,     GRutter about his extraordinary
OL,12,     Gmusical career in his 80th
OL,13,     Gbirthday year. Today, John talks
OL,14,     Gabout his long association with
OL,15,     GAmerica.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GCellist Natalie Clein and pianist
OL,18,     GGeorge Todica, plus an interview
OL,19,     Gwith Tom Service.
