OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 3 DEC
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music
OL,7,     Gfrom composers such as
OL,8,     GRachmaninov, Purcell and Spohr.
OL,9,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,10,     GThe BBC Philharmonic is joined by
OL,11,     GGemma New for Sibelius, Bacewicz
OL,12,     Gand a UK premiere by Gabriella
OL,13,     GSmith.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: Electronic Women
OL,15,     GHannah Peel delves into the
OL,16,     Gstories and sound worlds of five
OL,17,     Gfemale electronic pioneers.
OL,18,     GTonight, Eliane Radigue: pioneer,
OL,19,     Gmystic, and explorer of new
OL,20,     Gmusical consciousness.
